<h1>Rigging Handbook — Privacy Policy</h1>
<small>Last updated: 2 November 2026</small>
<p>Rigging Handbook is an Android application providing lifting equipment reference information, technical tables and calculators.</p>
<h2>Information We Collect</h2>
<p>Rigging Handbook does not require users to create an account or provide personal information. Its core features work offline. The developer does not intentionally collect personal information through the app.</p>
<h2>Advertising and Analytics</h2>
<p>The app does not contain advertising. It does not intentionally use third-party advertising or analytics services.</p>
<h2>Local Data</h2>
<p>App preferences and saved favourites may be stored locally on the user's device to support app functionality.</p>
<h2>Internet and Updates</h2>
<p>An internet connection is not required to use the app's reference tables or calculators. App updates may be distributed through Google Play, which processes information according to its own privacy policies.</p>
<h2>Data Sharing</h2>
<p>The developer does not intentionally transmit or sell personal data through the app.</p>
<h2>Data Security</h2>
<p>The app is designed to function offline and minimise data processing. Users should keep their device and app updated.</p>
<h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
<p>The app is intended as a professional technical reference and is not designed for children.</p>
<h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
<p>This privacy policy may be updated when the app's features or data practices change. The latest version will be published on this page.</p>
<h2>Contact</h2>
<p>For privacy questions, contact the developer using the contact details provided on the Rigging Handbook Google Play listing.</p>
